    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "The sum of two fractions is $\\frac{11}{9}$. One of the fractions is $\\frac13$. What is the other fraction?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac89$",
      "worked": "Subtract the known fraction from the sum.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{11}{9}-\\frac13&=\\frac{11}{9}-\\frac39\\\\\\frac{11}{9}-\\frac13&=\\frac89\\end{align*}$$\nThe other fraction is $\\frac89$.",
